  "targetAge": 15,
  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『ウルトラマンティガ』より｢ウルトラマンティガ マルチタイプ｣がFigure-rise Standardシリーズにラインアップ！",
      "en": "\"Ultraman Tiga Multi Type \" from \" Ultraman Tiga\" is now available in the Figure-rise Standard series!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 特徴的なボディカラーはパーツ分割で再現し、シールレスで組み立て可能。",
      "en": "• The characteristic body color can be reproduced by dividing the parts and can be assembled without seals."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 耳や後頭部、額のクリアに至るまで、色分けを徹底再現。",
      "en": "• The color coding is thoroughly reproduced, including the clear ears, back of the head, and forehead."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ゼペリオン光線の溜め/発射を再現するエフェクトパーツが付属。",
      "en": "• Comes with effect parts that reproduce the charging/firing of Zeperion's rays."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• ボディに内蔵された複数の可動軸により、ダイナミックなアクションポーズを再現可能。",
      "en": "• Multiple movable axes built into the body allow for dynamic action poses."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 首パーツが内側に入りこむことで頭部の可動が向上。",
      "en": "• Head movement is improved by moving the neck part inward."
    }
  ],
  "accessories": [
    {
      "ja": "ゼペリオン光線用エフェクト×1式",
      "en": "Zeperion ray effect x 1"
    },
    {
      "ja": "カラータイマー×2種",
      "en": "Color timer x 2 types"
    },
    {
      "ja": "ハンドパーツ×1式",
      "en": "Hand parts x 1 set"
    }
  ],
